WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A crumbling memory-bridge, suspended over an abyss of swirling oblivion, urgent.

2
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.300 align:center
Lyra: Falling! Hold!

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release. Reintegrate.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Lyra: Never!

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:20.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A narrow, twisting corridor within the bridge's remnants, barely holding against the Loom's pressure, desperate.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.500 align:center
Lyra: Too close! No...

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.800 align:center
Kael: Use it... Lyra. Now.

8
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Worthless. Surrender.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.400 align:center
Lyra: Not this one! Damn it!

10
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:35.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A confined, collapsing chamber, the Loom's maw filling the entrance, dread.

11
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Accept the truth. Peace.

12
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.300 align:center
Lyra: Your peace is silence!

13
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.600 align:center
Kael: The fissure... behind you!

14
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.900 align:center
Lyra: Got it!

15
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in A labyrinth of burning memory-structures, twisted and unstable, desperate.

16
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.500 align:center
Echo Shard: Lost... forgotten...

17
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.800 align:center
Lyra: Get back! Where is it?

18
00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.100 align:center
Kael: The path... to the north...

19
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:04.400 align:center
♪ at dawn, in A precarious ledge overlooking a chasm of lost data, within the burning labyrinth, tense.

20
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.700 align:center
Lyra: Almost... there!

21
00:01:05.1000 --> 00:01:07.1000 align:center
Kael: Careful... Lyra. It's fragile.

22
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.300 align:center
Lyra: Got it!

23
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:15.600 align:center
♪ at dawn, in A dead-end corridor, walls closing in, Echo Shards swarming, urgent.

24
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:16.900 align:center
Echo Shard: Mine... ours...

25
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.200 align:center
Lyra: Too many! Can't hold!

26
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.500 align:center
Kael: That one! The light!

27
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.800 align:center
Lyra: Kael?

28
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:30.100 align:center
♪ at dusk, in At the threshold of Kael's essence shard, the Loom's song growing deafening, agony.

29
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.400 align:center
Lyra: Your essence... so bright.

30
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The end nears. Join us.

31
00:01:34.1000 --> 00:01:35.1000 align:center
Kael: Lyra... please...

32
00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.300 align:center
Lyra: What remains... if I lose you?

33
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:44.600 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The collapsing corridor, Loom's tendrils breaching the walls, desperate.

34
00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:45.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Pointless. Futile.

35
00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.200 align:center
Lyra: No! Mine!

36
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.500 align:center
Kael: Thank you... Lyra.

37
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:55.800 align:center
♪ at dusk, in A precipice overlooking the Loom of Oblivion, its maw wide open, desperate.

38
00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.100 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me! Kael!

39
00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: UNACCEPTABLE!

40
00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.700 align:center
Lyra: Gone...

41
00:02:00.1000 --> 00:02:06.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The desolate precipice, now quiet and empty, despair.

42
00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.300 align:center
Lyra: Alone. So alone.

43
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.600 align:center
Lyra: No echo. Just... emptiness.

44
00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:17.900 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A desolate, featureless plain of forgotten memories, dread.

45
00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.200 align:center
Lyra: What is this?

46
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The path chosen. Foretold.

47
00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.800 align:center
Lyra: It knows. Everything.
